  "description": "Bring familiar LINQ queries to CSV and XLSX files. Work with typed C# objects, stream results, export Excel workbooks, and create or extend CSV files. Write to paths or streams, with date formats, boolean/null tokens, and custom converters. .NET 10+, Native AOT, and no extra runtime package dependencies.",
