  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Prerelease: Export typed records to single-worksheet XLSX workbooks with XlsxWriter and Write/WriteAsync. Supports paths, writable streams, sync/async factories, native cells, explicit text annotations, and strict precision checks. Opt into staged overwrite for XLSX exports or CSV creation with ExistingFileBehavior.Overwrite. Includes LINQ queries, CSV append/insertion, Native AOT, and a BCL-only runtime. API changes remain possible.",
